In item no. 5, the outcome was "yes" for each of the 24 paired entries, so the "yes" response rate was 96%. It is essential to respond correctly to all items. Any wrong response can only delay the full efficiency of the electronic interface. It is not possible to request additional information about an item, as it is completed automatically by the interface. The most important result from this test was that the participants could quickly and correctly identify all of the symbols.

